<title>GREECE: GREEK 1M ATHIBOR RISES TO 14.04 FROM 13.94PCT.</title>
<headline>GREEK 1M ATHIBOR RISES TO 14.04 FROM 13.94PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate</p>
<p>(Athibor) for one month rose to 14.04 percent from 13.94 percent</p>
<p>on Wednesday and the bid rate (Athibid) firmed to 13.25 from</p>
<p>13.19 percent.</p>
